ety Effectiveness Awards recognise effectiveness in research, insights and analytics; and provide a platform from which to demonstrate the importance of research, researchers and research companies as an integral part of a successful business and social policy planning.','no'),(2823,'_options_rea_text','field_5e8d4ca9d5d4a','no'),(2824,'options_rea_link_url','http://researchawards.com.au/award-categories/research-effectiveness-awards/','no'),(2825,'_options_rea_link_url','field_5e8d4cc1d5d4b','no'),(2826,'options_rea_link_text','Find out more','no'),(2827,'_options_rea_link_text','field_5e8d4cd1d5d4c','no'),(2828,'options_conf_title','Conference Awards','no'),(2829,'_options_conf_title','field_5e8d4f5783a56','no'),(2830,'options_conf_text','<i class=\"fas fa-chevron-right\"></i> <strong>Best Paper award</strong>\r\n<i class=\"fas fa-chevron-right\"></i> <strong>Best Presentation Award</strong>\r\n<i class=\"fas fa-chevron-right\"></i> <strong>Best Presentation by a Young Researcher</strong>\r\n<i class=\"fas fa-chevron-right\"></i> <strong>Best Chair at the Conference Award</strong>\r\n\r\nThe Conference Awards recognise intellectual rigour, thought leadership and presentation skills at the annual Research Society National Conference which is the largest research conference in the southern hemisphere and the highlight of the research profession calendar.','no'),(2831,'_options_conf_text','field_5e8d4f7ff1d25','no'),(2832,'options_conf_link_url','http://researchawards.com.au/award-categories/conference-awards/','no'),(2833,'_options_conf_link_url','field_5e8d4f969c7af','no'),(2834,'options_conf_link_text','Find out more','no'),(2835,'_options_conf_link_text','field_5e8d4fa69c7b1','no'),(2836,'options_fellow_title','Fellowship Awards','no'),(2837,'_options_fellow_title','field_5e8d4fffafce3','no'),(2838,'options_fellow_text','Fellowship is the highest honour the Society can bestow on a member, recognising those who have made a significant contribution to the profession over a sustained period.\r\n\r\nCurrent financial full members of the Research Society are invited to nominate a colleague for election as a Fellow of the Society.','no'),(2839,'_options_fellow_text','field_5e8d500cafce4','no'),(2840,'options_fellow_link_url','http://researchawards.com.au/award-categories/fellowship-awards/','no'),(2841,'_options_fellow_link_url','field_5e8d5016afce5','no'),(2842,'options_fellow_link_text','Find out more','no'),(2843,'_options_fellow_link_text','field_5e8d5025afce6','no'),(3048,'acf_pro_license','YToyOntzOjM6ImtleSI7czo3MjoiYjNKa1pYSmZhV1E5TVRFME16TXpmSFI1Y0dVOWNHVnljMjl1WVd4OFpHRjBaVDB5TURFM0xUQTVMVEV5SURBek9qQXpPak01IjtzOjM6InVybCI7czoxNjoiaHR0cDovL2xvY2FsaG9zdCI7fQ==','yes'),(3057,'duplicate_page_options','a:4:{s:21:\"duplicate_post_status\";s:5:\"draft\";s:23:\"duplicate_post_redirect\";s:7:\"to_list\";s:21:\"duplicate_post_suffix\";s:0:\"\";s:21:\"duplicate_post_editor\";s:7:\"classic\";}','yes'),(3155,'options_collection_statement','We\'ll keep you updated about the campaign. <a href=\"/collection-statement/\">Find out more here.</a>','no'),(3156,'_options_collection_statement','field_5df862cc60215','no'),(3397,'wow_mwp_updater_4.0','4.0','yes'),(3398,'wow_license_key_mwp','edc21f3b424385eb2f35114560595982','yes'),(3402,'wow_license_expire_mwp','lifetime','yes'),(3752,'theme_mods_AMSRO-2020','a:4:{i:0;b:0;s:18:\"nav_menu_locations\";a:4:{s:11:\"header-menu\";i:24;s:11:\"header-2019\";i:24;s:11:\"footer-menu\";i:23;s:11:\"splash-menu\";i:0;}s:18:\"custom_css_post_id\";i:-1;s:16:\"sidebars_widgets\";a:2:{s:4:\"time\";i:1600151429;s:4:\"data\";a:5:{s:19:\"wp_inactive_widgets\";a:0:{}s:9:\"sidebar-1\";a:3:{i:0;s:8:\"search-2\";i:1;s:14:\"recent-posts-2\";i:2;s:12:\"categories-2\";}s:9:\"sidebar-2\";a:0:{}s:9:\"sidebar-3\";a:0:{}s:9:\"sidebar-4\";a:0:{}}}}','no'),(3763,'theme_mods_amsro2020','a:4:{i:0;b:0;s:18:\"nav_menu_locations\";a:2:{s:11:\"footer-menu\";i:23;s:9:\"main-menu\";i:24;}s:18:\"custom_css_post_id\";i:-1;s:16:\"sid