 being proposed across two clusters at Mount Hope and Black Stump that  will be capable of generating 2,000,000 megawatt hours of clean renewable energy each year.'),(55831,1756,'_sec_3_text','field_5de6e4044e5e8'),(55832,1756,'page_col_image_2','436'),(55833,1756,'_page_col_image_2','field_5de6546e7c63a'),(55834,1756,'sec_2_button','<a class=\"btn btn-home\" href=\"/hyveclean/community\">More about the community</a> <a class=\"btn btn-home\" href=\"/hyveclean/about/\">Positives for the area</a> <a class=\"btn btn-home\" href=\"#contact\">Contact us</a>\r\n'),(55835,1756,'_sec_2_button','field_5de6e58c86706'),(55836,1756,'sec_3_button','<a class=\"btn btn-home\" href=\"/hyveclean/the-project/\">Detailed project description</a> <a class=\"btn btn-home\" href=\"#location\">Location map</a>'),(55837,1756,'_sec_3_button','field_5de6e5a243c03'),(55838,1756,'page_col_image_4','455'),(55839,1756,'_page_col_image_4','field_5de70801090ce'),(55840,1756,'sec_4_title','Location'),(55841,1756,'_sec_4_title','field_5de7082a12a81'),(55842,1756,'sec_4_text','The project will be located in Central NSW about 5km south-west of the small rural township of Coolah. About 120 wind turbines are being proposed across two clusters at Mount Hope and Black Stump.'),(55843,1756,'_sec_4_text','field_5de7084812a82'),(55844,1756,'sec_4_button','<a class=\"btn btn-home\" href=\"/hyveclean/about/\">Detailed location information</a>'),(55845,1756,'_sec_4_button','field_5de7085e12a83'),(55846,1756,'news_title','Project updates'),(55847,1756,'_news_title','field_5de78da3aabb9'),(55848,1756,'sec_2_text_copy',''),(55849,1756,'_sec_2_text_copy','field_5de78dc89e613'),(55850,1756,'timeline-title','Timeline'),(55851,1756,'_timeline-title','field_5de78df29e615'),(55852,1756,'timeline_title','Timeline'),(55853,1756,'_timeline_title','field_5de78df29e615'),(55854,1756,'contact_title','Contact us'),(55855,1756,'_contact_title','field_5de7981e06057'),(55856,1756,'contact_intro','Contact text...'),(55857,1756,'_c