,'report_link_text','Download'),(56255,1756,'_report_link_text','field_62f30f01b57e4'),(56256,1756,'solutions_content','The housing system is complex, and no one solution will solve the complex problems we now face but there are some critical first steps to be taken now.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Set out an ambitious national housing agreement between commonwealth and state governments with targets and funding for the construction of affordable homes.</li>\r\n 	<li>Phase out tax breaks for property investors and using the increase in revenue to build more public housing.</li>\r\n 	<li>Establish laws which limit rental increases beyond what is fair.</li>\r\n 	<li>Rebalance tenancy laws to provide renters with more security and control, such as eliminating no grounds evictions.</li>\r\n 	<li>Phase out stamp duty and replace it with a broad-based land tax.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>While there are many opinions on what policy changes will fix the housing market, doing nothing is not an option.</h4>'),(56257,1756,'_solutions_content','field_640e8b307a958'),(56258,1756,'problem_icons_0_prob_icon','1699'),(56259,1756,'_problem_icons_0_prob_icon','field_640fa0291d519'),(56260,1756,'problem_icons_0_prob_concerned_stat','70% highly concerned'),(56261,1756,'_problem_icons_0_prob_concerned_stat','field_640fa0dd81d95'),(56262,1756,'problem_icons_0_prob_concerded_text','are highly concerned'),(56263,1756,'_problem_icons_0_prob_concerded_text','field_640fa10181d96'),(56264,1756,'problem_icons_0_prob_issue_text',''),(56265,1756,'_problem_icons_0_prob_issue_text','field_640fa11a81d97'),(56266,1756,'problem_icons','4'),(56267,1756,'_problem_icons','field_640fa0191d518'),(56268,1756,'ceh_content_left',''),(56269,1756,'_ceh_content_left','field_640e97e8f1c8c'),(56270,1756,'ceh_content_right',''),(56271,1756,'_ceh_content_right','field_640e97fdf1c8d'),(56272,1756,'pc_content_left',''),(56273,1756,'_pc_content_left','field_640e983bf1c8f'),(56274,1756,'pc_content_right',''),(56275,1756,'_pc_content_ri