40fa10181d96'),(59951,1813,'monitor_content','The Australian Housing Monitor is a large, nationally-representative survey covering public experiences and attitudes toward housing related issues. Questions range from how well the respondent is keeping up with their mortgage/rent, to what they think about social housing construction.\r\n\r\nA broad range of demographic criteria are included, such as gender, location, age, income, voting preference, educational level, tenure type, and employment status. These variables allow CEH researchers to understand the trends and diversity of opinion around the country.\r\n\r\nIt also incorporates questions from previous surveys to track trends over time.\r\nThe inaugural poll was conducted by Essential in December 2022, and was completed by 4,735 people.'),(59952,1813,'_monitor_content','field_640fcc4014404'),(59953,1813,'problem_head','Housing in Australia is not working, and Australians are concerned.'),(59954,1813,'_problem_head','field_641935436aded'),(59955,1813,'problem_signoff','Explore the research showing how concerned Australians are our about the housing situation.'),(59956,1813,'_problem_signoff','field_641935626adee'),(59957,1813,'sections','a:2:{i:0;s:4:\"hero\";i:1;s:9:\"news_grid\";}'),(59958,1813,'_sections','field_5dafb40b8143a'),(59959,1813,'sections_0_is_full_height','1'),(59960,1813,'_sections_0_is_full_height','field_61d6f6fd5a37e'),(59961,1813,'sections_0_image','1648'),(59962,1813,'_sections_0_image','field_61d6f6d45a37d'),(59963,1813,'sections_0_heading','Heading'),(59964,1813,'_sections_0_heading','field_61d6f69e5a379'),(59965,1813,'sections_0_subtitle','Ya ya '),(59966,1813,'_sections_0_subtitle','field_61d6f6ac5a37a'),(59967,1813,'sections_0_link_one',''),(59968,1813,'_sections_0_link_one','field_61d6f6b55a37b'),(59969,1813,'sections_0_link_two',''),(59970,1813,'_sections_0_link_two','field_61d6f6c35a37c'),(59971,1813,'sections_1_select_categories','a:1:{i:0;s:2:\"27\";}'),(59972,1813,'_sections_1_select_categories','field_637f04483b63b'),(59973,1813,'intro_head_major','Queenslanders are known for both our love of the great outdoors and our state pride…'),(59974,1813,'_intro_head_major','field_64e828783ad9f'),(59975,1813,'intro_head_minor','But there’s a few things you might not know about our beautiful state.'),(59976,1813,'_intro_head_minor','field_64e8288c3ada0'),(59977,1813,'intro_icons_0_int_icon','1806'),(59978,1813,'_intro_icons_0_int_icon','field_64e828b33ada2'),(59979,1813,'intro_icons_0_int_icon_text','At 1,727,000 square kilometres, we’re 2.5 times the size of Texas. <span>Yeeha!</span>'),(59980,1813,'_intro_icons_0_int_icon_text','field_64e828e33ada3'),(59981,1813,'intro_icons_1_int_icon','1806'),(59982,1813,'_intro_icons_1_int_icon','field_64e828b33ada2'),(59983,1813,'intro_icons_1_int_icon_text','We have twice as many species of native plant and animal as any other Australian state or territory.'),(59984,1813,'_intro_icons_1_int_icon_text','field_64e828e33ada3'),(59985,1813,'intro_icons_2_int_icon','1806'),(59986,1813,'_intro_icons_2_int_icon','field_64e828b33ada2'),(59987,1813,'intro_icons_2_int_icon_text','We have less land classified as ‘protected’ than any other state or territory.'),(59988,1813,'_intro_icons_2_int_icon_text','field_64e828e33ada3'),(59989,1813,'intro_icons','3'),(59990,1813,'_intro_icons','field_64e828963ada1'),(59991,6,'threat_head_major','What we stand to lose if we don’t act soon to protect beautiful Queensland:'),(59992,6,'_threat_head_major','field_64ec258d9dbd1'),(59993,6,'threats_icons','3'),(59994,6,'_threats_icons','field_64ec2551a93f9'),(59995,1813,'threat_head_major',''),(59996,1813,'_threat_head_major','field_64ec258d9dbd1'),(59997,1813,'threats_icons',''),(59998,1813,'_threats_icons','field_64ec2551a93f9'),(60148,6,'threats_icons_0_thr_icon','1819'),(60149,6,'_threats_icons_0_thr_icon','field_64ec2551a93fa'),(60150,6,'threats_icons_0_thr_icon_text','The rich cultural heritage of our First Nations people and their continuous ties to country, dating back more than 50,000 years.'),(60151,6,'_threats_icons_0_thr_icon_text','field_64ec2551a93fb'),(60152,6,'threats_icons_1_thr_icon','1819'),(60153,6,'_threats_icons_1_thr_icon','field_64ec2551a93fa'),(60154,6,'threats_icons_1_thr_icon_text','Thousands of species of plant and animal which are now classified as threatened or endangered in Queensland.'),(60155,6,'_threats_icons_1_thr_icon_text','field_64ec2551a93fb'),(60156,6,'threats_icons_2_thr_icon','1819'),(60157,6,'_threats_icons_2_thr_icon','field_64ec2551a93fa'),(60158,6,'threats_icons_2_thr_icon_text','The access to nature that is central to the Queensland way of life.'),(60159,6,'_threats_icons_2_thr_icon_text','field_64ec2551a93fb'),(60160,1820,'banner_head',''),(60161,1820,'_banner_head','field_5b568121a8ffe'),(60162,1820,'banner_sub',''),(60163,1820,'_banner_sub','field_5b568139fd366'),(60164,1820,'banner_button','<a class=\"btn btn-home\" style=\"width: 200px;\" href=\"#project\">Sign the petition</a>'),(60165,1820,'_banner_button','field_5b568147fd367'),(60166,1820,'support_section_title','How can Lifestart support you?'),(60167,1820,'_support_section_title','field_5b67c7d060398'),(60168,1820,'support_left_title','Services'),(60169,1820,'_support_left_title','field_5b67c298e7f8f'),(60170,1820,'support_left_cont','Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetuer adipiscing elit, sed diam nonummy.'),(60171,1820,'_support_left_cont','field_5b67c5f6e7f91'),(60172,1820,'support_left_button','<a class=\"btn btn-green\" href=\"/services/\">View all services</a>'),(60173,1820,'_support_left_button','field_5b67c60ae7f92'),(60174,1820,'support_ctr_title','Talk to us'),(60175,1820,'_support_ctr_title','field_5b67c62a58af3'),(60176,1820,'support_ctr_cont','Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetuer adipiscing elit, sed diam nonummy nibh euismod tincidunt ut laoreet.'),(60177,1820,'_support_ctr_cont','field_5b67c63158af4'),(60178,1820,'support_ctr_button','<a class=\"btn btn-orange\" href=\"/supports/\">Find us</a>'),(60179,1820,'_support_ctr_button','field_5b67c63658af5'),(60180,1820,'support_right_title','NDIS Registered provider'),(60181,1820,'_support_right_title','field_5b67c6a38c064'),(60182,1820,'support_right_cont','Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetuer adipiscing elit, sed diam nonummy nibh euismod tincidunt ut.'),(60183,1820,'_support_right_cont','field_5b67c6c98c065'),(60184,1820,'support_right_button','<a class=\"btn btn-blue\" href=\"#\">Read more</a>'),(60185,1820,'_support_right_button','field_5b67c6dd8c066'),(60186,1820,'first_image_title','Lifestart is about supporting young children'),(60187,1820,'_first_image_title','field_5b67ca606afc4'),(60188,1820,'first_image_cont','from 0-24 years living with disabilities and their familes'),(60189,1820,'_first_image_cont','field_5b67caff6afc5'),(60190,1820,'first_image_button','<a class=\"btn\" href=\"#\">Learn more</a>'),(60191,1820,'_first_image_button','field_5b67cb0d6afc6'),(60192,1820,'second _image_title','Lifestart is about supporting young children'),(60193,1820,'_second _image_title','field_5b67cb20ddf9a'),(60194,1820,'second_image_cont','from 0-24 years living with disabilities and their familes'),(60195,1820,'_second_image_cont','field_5b67cb24ddf9b'),(60196,1820,'second_image_button','<a class=\"btn btn-blue\" href=\"/about/\">Learn more</a>'),(60197,1820,'_second_image_button','field_5b67cb29ddf9c'),(60198,1820,'second_image_title','Lifestart is about supporting young children'),(60199,1820,'_second_image_title','field_5b67cb20ddf9a'),(60200,1820,'page_col_image','412'),(60201,1820,'_page_col_image','field_5de6546e7c63a'),(60202,1820,'page_col_image_3','437'),(60203,1820,'_page_col_image_3','field_5de6e3998e07e'),(60204,1820,'sec_2_title','Community'),(60205,1820,'_sec_2_title','field_5de6e3ef2798f'),(60206,1820,'sec_2_text','The project will be located about 5km south-west of the small rural township of Coolah. Sheep and cattle have grazed the undulating valleys and rocky outcrops across the region since the early days of European settlement.'),(60207,1820,'_sec_2_text','field_5de78dc89e613'),(60208,1820,'sec_3_title','The Project'),(60209,1820,'_sec_3_title','field_5de6e3d37d8da'),(60210,1820,'sec_3_text','The Valley of the Winds project is an 800 megawatt wind farm that is in the early stages of planning. About 120 wind turbines are being proposed across two clusters at Mount Hope and Black Stump that  will be capable of generating 2,000,000 megawatt hours of clean renewable energy each year.'),(60211,1820,'_sec_3_text','field_5de6e4044e5e8'),(60212,1820,'page_col_image_2','436'),(60213,1820,'_page_col_image_2','field_5de6546e7c63a'),(60214,1820,'sec_2_button','<a class=\"btn btn-home\" href=\"/hyveclean/community\">More about the community</a> <a class=\"btn btn-home\" href=\"/hyveclean/about/\">Positives for the area</a> <a class=\"btn btn-home\" href=\"#contact\">Contact us</a>\r\n'),(60215,1820,'_sec_2_button','field_5de6e58c86706'),(60216,1820,'sec_3_button','<a class=\"btn btn-home\" href=\"/hyveclean/the-project/\">Detailed project description</a> <a class=\"btn btn-home\" href=\"#location\">Location map</a>'),(60217,1820,'_sec_3_button','field_5de6e5a243c03'),(60218,1820,'page_col_image_4','455'),(60219,1820,'_page_col_image_4','field_5de70801090ce'),(60220,1820,'sec_4_title','Location'),(60221,1820,'_sec_4_title','field_5de7082a12a81'),(60222,1820,'sec_4_text','The project will be located in Central NSW about 5km south-west of the small rural township of Coolah. About 120 wind turbines are being proposed across two clusters at Mount Hope and Black Stump.'),(60223,1820,'_sec_4_text','field_5de7084812a82'),(60224,1820,'sec_4_button','<a class=\"btn btn-home\" href=\"/hyveclean/about/\">Detailed location information</a>'),(60225,1820,'_sec_4_button','field_5de7085e12a83'),(60226,1820,'news_title','Project updates'),(60227,1820,'_news_title','field_5de78da3aabb9'),(60228,1820,'sec_2_text_copy',''),(60229,1820,'_sec_2_text_copy','field