n will solve the complex problems we now face but there are some critical first steps to be taken now.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Set out an ambitious national housing agreement between commonwealth and state governments with targets and funding for the construction of affordable homes.</li>\r\n 	<li>Phase out tax breaks for property investors and using the increase in revenue to build more public housing.</li>\r\n 	<li>Establish laws which limit rental increases beyond what is fair.</li>\r\n 	<li>Rebalance tenancy laws to provide renters with more security and control, such as eliminating no grounds evictions.</li>\r\n 	<li>Phase out stamp duty and replace it with a broad-based land tax.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>While there are many opinions on what policy changes will fix the housing market, doing nothing is not an option.</h4>'),(74281,1868,'_solutions_content','field_640e8b307a958'),(74282,1868,'problem_icons_0_prob_icon','1699'),(74283,1868,'_problem_icons_0_prob_icon','field_640fa0291d519'),(74284,1868,'problem_icons_0_prob_concerned_stat','70% highly concerned'),(74285,1868,'_problem_icons_0_prob_concerned_stat','field_640fa0dd81d95'),(74286,1868,'problem_icons_0_prob_concerded_text','are highly concerned'),(74287,1868,'_problem_icons_0_prob_concerded_text','field_640fa10181d96'),(74288,1868,'problem_icons_0_prob_issue_text',''),(74289,1868,'_problem_icons_0_prob_issue_text','field_640fa11a81d97'),(74290,1868,'problem_icons','4'),(74291,1868,'_problem_icons','field_640fa0191d518'),(74292,1868,'ceh_content_left',''),(74293,1868,'_ceh_content_left','field_640e97e8f1c8c'),(74294,1868,'ceh_content_right',''),(74295,1868,'_ceh_content_right','field_640e97fdf1c8d'),(74296,1868,'pc_content_left',''),(74297,1868,'_pc_content_left','field_640e983bf1c8f'),(74298,1868,'pc_content_right',''),(74299,1868,'_pc_content_right','field_640e984df1c90'),(74300,1868,'problem_icons_1_prob_icon','1699'),(74301,1868,'_problem_icons_1_prob_icon','field_640fa0291d519'),(74302,1868,'problem_icons_1_