pe and Black Stump that  will be capable of generating 2,000,000 megawatt hours of clean renewable energy each year.'),(75147,1870,'_sec_3_text','field_5de6e4044e5e8'),(75148,1870,'page_col_image_2','436'),(75149,1870,'_page_col_image_2','field_5de6546e7c63a'),(75150,1870,'sec_2_button','<a class=\"btn btn-home\" href=\"/hyveclean/community\">More about the community</a> <a class=\"btn btn-home\" href=\"/hyveclean/about/\">Positives for the area</a> <a class=\"btn btn-home\" href=\"#contact\">Contact us</a>\r\n'),(75151,1870,'_sec_2_button','field_5de6e58c86706'),(75152,1870,'sec_3_button','<a class=\"btn btn-home\" href=\"/hyveclean/the-project/\">Detailed project description</a> <a class=\"btn btn-home\" href=\"#location\">Location map</a>'),(75153,1870,'_sec_3_button','field_5de6e5a243c03'),(75154,1870,'page_col_image_4','455'),(75155,1870,'_page_col_image_4','field_5de70801090ce'),(75156,1870,'sec_4_title','Location'),(75157,1870,'_sec_4_title','field_5de7082a12a81'),(75158,1870,'sec_4_text','The project will be located in Central NSW about 5km south-west of the small rural township of Coolah. About 120 wind turbines are being proposed across two clusters at Mount Hope and Black Stump.'),(75159,1870,'_sec_4_text','field_5de7084812a82'),(75160,1870,'sec_4_button','<a class=\"btn btn-home\" href=\"/hyveclean/about/\">Detailed location information</a>'),(75161,1870,'_sec_4_button','field_5de7085e12a83'),(75162,1870,'news_title','Project updates'),(75163,1870,'_news_title','field_5de78da3aabb9'),(75164,1870,'sec_2_text_copy',''),(75165,1870,'_sec_2_text_copy','field_5de78dc89e613'),(75166,1870,'timeline-title','Timeline'),(75167,1870,'_timeline-title','field_5de78df29e615'),(75168,1870,'timeline_title','Timeline'),(75169,1870,'_timeline_title','field_5de78df29e615'),(75170,1870,'contact_title','Contact us'),(75171,1870,'_contact_title','field_5de7981e06057'),(75172,1870,'contact_intro','Contact text...'),(75173,1870,'_contact_intro','field_5de7983506058'),(75174,187