em_head','Housing in Australia is not working, and Australians are concerned.'),(78213,1875,'_problem_head','field_641935436aded'),(78214,1875,'problem_signoff','Explore the research showing how concerned Australians are our about the housing situation.'),(78215,1875,'_problem_signoff','field_641935626adee'),(78216,1875,'sections','a:2:{i:0;s:4:\"hero\";i:1;s:9:\"news_grid\";}'),(78217,1875,'_sections','field_5dafb40b8143a'),(78218,1875,'sections_0_is_full_height','1'),(78219,1875,'_sections_0_is_full_height','field_61d6f6fd5a37e'),(78220,1875,'sections_0_image','1648'),(78221,1875,'_sections_0_image','field_61d6f6d45a37d'),(78222,1875,'sections_0_heading','Heading'),(78223,1875,'_sections_0_heading','field_61d6f69e5a379'),(78224,1875,'sections_0_subtitle','Ya ya '),(78225,1875,'_sections_0_subtitle','field_61d6f6ac5a37a'),(78226,1875,'sections_0_link_one',''),(78227,1875,'_sections_0_link_one','field_61d6f6b55a37b'),(78228,1875,'sections_0_link_two',''),(78229,1875,'_sections_0_link_two','field_61d6f6c35a37c'),(78230,1875,'sections_1_select_categories','a:1:{i:0;s:2:\"27\";}'),(78231,1875,'_sections_1_select_categories','field_637f04483b63b'),(78232,1875,'intro_head_major','Queenslanders are known for both our love of the great outdoors and our state pride…'),(78233,1875,'_intro_head_major','field_64e828783ad9f'),(78234,1875,'intro_head_minor','But there’s a few things you might not know about our beautiful state.'),(78235,1875,'_intro_head_minor','field_64e8288c3ada0'),(78236,1875,'intro_icons_0_int_icon','1806'),(78237,1875,'_intro_icons_0_int_icon','field_64e828b33ada2'),(78238,1875,'intro_icons_0_int_icon_text','At 1,727,000 square kilometres, we’re 2.5 times the size of Texas. <span>Yeeha!</span>'),(78239,1875,'_intro_icons_0_int_icon_text','field_64e828e33ada3'),(78240,1875,'intro_icons_1_int_icon','1806'),(78241,1875,'_intro_icons_1_int_icon','field_64e828b33ada2'),(78242,1875,'intro_icons_1_int_icon_text','We have twice as many species of native plant and animal as any other Australian state or territory.'),(78243,1875,'_intro_icons_1_int_icon_text','field_64e828e33ada3'),(78244,1875,'intro_icons_2_int_icon','1806'),(78245,1875,'_intro_icons_2_int_icon','field_64e828b33ada2'),(78246,1875,'intro_icons_2_int_icon_text','We have less land classified as ‘protected’ than any other state or territory.'),(78247,1875,'_intro_icons_2_int_icon_text','field_64e828e33ada3'),(78248,1875,'intro_icons','3'),(78249,1875,'_intro_icons','field_64e828963ada1'),(78250,1875,'threat_head_major','What we stand to lose if we don’t act soon to protect beautiful Queensland:'),(78251,1875,'_threat_head_major','field_64ec258d9dbd1'),(78252,1875,'threats_icons','3'),(78253,1875,'_threats_icons','field_64ec2551a93f9'),(78254,1875,'threats_icons_0_thr_icon','1819'),(78255,1875,'_threats_icons_0_thr_icon','field_64ec2551a93fa'),(78256,1875,'threats_icons_0_thr_icon_text','The rich cultural heritage of our First Nations people and their continuous ties to country, dating back more than 50,000 years.'),(78257,1875,'_threats_icons_0_thr_icon_text','field_64ec2551a93fb'),(78258,1875,'threats_icons_1_thr_icon','1819'),(78259,1875,'_threats_icons_1_thr_icon','field_64ec2551a93fa'),(78260,1875,'threats_icons_1_thr_icon_text','Thousands of species of plant and animal which are now classified as threatened or endangered in Queensland.'),(78261,1875,'_threats_icons_1_thr_icon_text','field_64ec2551a93fb'),(78262,1875,'threats_icons_2_thr_icon','1819'),(78263,1875,'_threats_icons_2_thr_icon','field_64ec2551a93fa'),(78264,1875,'threats_icons_2_thr_icon_text','The access to nature that is central to the Queensland way of life.'),(78265,1875,'_threats_icons_2_thr_icon_text','field_64ec2551a93fb'),(78266,1875,'threat_icons_0_thr_icon','1824'),(78267,1875,'_threat_icons_0_thr_icon','field_64ec2551a93fa'),(78268,1875,'threat_icons_0_thr_icon_text','The <span>rich cultural heritage</span> of our First Nations people and their continuous ties to country, dating back mo