 first steps to be taken now.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Set out an ambitious national housing agreement between commonwealth and state governments with targets and funding for the construction of affordable homes.</li>\r\n 	<li>Phase out tax breaks for property investors and using the increase in revenue to build more public housing.</li>\r\n 	<li>Establish laws which limit rental increases beyond what is fair.</li>\r\n 	<li>Rebalance tenancy laws to provide renters with more security and control, such as eliminating no grounds evictions.</li>\r\n 	<li>Phase out stamp duty and replace it with a broad-based land tax.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>While there are many opinions on what policy changes will fix the housing market, doing nothing is not an option.</h4>'),(95067,1951,'_solutions_content','field_640e8b307a958'),(95068,1951,'problem_icons_0_prob_icon','1699'),(95069,1951,'_problem_icons_0_prob_icon','field_640fa0291d519'),(95070,1951,'problem_icons_0_prob_concerned_stat','70% highly concerned'),(95071,1951,'_problem_icons_0_prob_concerned_stat','field_640fa0dd81d95'),(95072,1951,'problem_icons_0_prob_concerded_text','are highly concerned'),(95073,1951,'_problem_icons_0_prob_concerded_text','field_640fa10181d96'),(95074,1951,'problem_icons_0_prob_issue_text',''),(95075,1951,'_problem_icons_0_prob_issue_text','field_640fa11a81d97'),(95076,1951,'problem_icons','4'),(95077,1951,'_problem_icons','field_640fa0191d518'),(95078,1951,'ceh_content_left',''),(95079,1951,'_ceh_content_left','field_640e97e8f1c8c'),(95080,1951,'ceh_content_right',''),(95081,1951,'_ceh_content_right','field_640e97fdf1c8d'),(95082,1951,'pc_content_left',''),(95083,1951,'_pc_content_left','field_640e983bf1c8f'),(95084,1951,'pc_content_right',''),(95085,1951,'_pc_content_right','field_640e984df1c90'),(95086,1951,'problem_icons_1_prob_icon','1699'),(95087,1951,'_problem_icons_1_prob_icon','field_640fa0291d519'),(95088,1951,'problem_icons_1_prob_concerned_stat','69% highly concerned'),(95089,1951,'_problem_icons_