commonwealth and state governments with targets and funding for the construction of affordable homes.</li>\r\n 	<li>Phase out tax breaks for property investors and using the increase in revenue to build more public housing.</li>\r\n 	<li>Establish laws which limit rental increases beyond what is fair.</li>\r\n 	<li>Rebalance tenancy laws to provide renters with more security and control, such as eliminating no grounds evictions.</li>\r\n 	<li>Phase out stamp duty and replace it with a broad-based land tax.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>While there are many opinions on what policy changes will fix the housing market, doing nothing is not an option.</h4>'),(104210,2005,'_solutions_content','field_640e8b307a958'),(104211,2005,'problem_icons_0_prob_icon','1699'),(104212,2005,'_problem_icons_0_prob_icon','field_640fa0291d519'),(104213,2005,'problem_icons_0_prob_concerned_stat','70% highly concerned'),(104214,2005,'_problem_icons_0_prob_concerned_stat','field_640fa0dd81d95'),(104215,2005,'problem_icons_0_prob_concerded_text','are highly concerned'),(104216,2005,'_problem_icons_0_prob_concerded_text','field_640fa10181d96'),(104217,2005,'problem_icons_0_prob_issue_text',''),(104218,2005,'_problem_icons_0_prob_issue_text','field_640fa11a81d97'),(104219,2005,'problem_icons','4'),(104220,2005,'_problem_icons','field_640fa0191d518'),(104221,2005,'ceh_content_left',''),(104222,2005,'_ceh_content_left','field_640e97e8f1c8c'),(104223,2005,'ceh_content_right',''),(104224,2005,'_ceh_content_right','field_640e97fdf1c8d'),(104225,2005,'pc_content_left',''),(104226,2005,'_pc_content_left','field_640e983bf1c8f'),(104227,2005,'pc_content_right',''),(104228,2005,'_pc_content_right','field_640e984df1c90'),(104229,2005,'problem_icons_1_prob_icon','1699'),(104230,2005,'_problem_icons_1_prob_icon','field_640fa0291d519'),(104231,2005,'problem_icons_1_prob_concerned_stat','69% highly concerned'),(104232,2005,'_problem_icons_1_prob_concerned_stat','field_640fa0dd81d95'),(104233,2005,'problem_icons_1_prob