erty investors and using the increase in revenue to build more public housing.</li>\r\n 	<li>Establish laws which limit rental increases beyond what is fair.</li>\r\n 	<li>Rebalance tenancy laws to provide renters with more security and control, such as eliminating no grounds evictions.</li>\r\n 	<li>Phase out stamp duty and replace it with a broad-based land tax.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>While there are many opinions on what policy changes will fix the housing market, doing nothing is not an option.</h4>'),(116508,2124,'_solutions_content','field_640e8b307a958'),(116509,2124,'problem_icons_0_prob_icon','1699'),(116510,2124,'_problem_icons_0_prob_icon','field_640fa0291d519'),(116511,2124,'problem_icons_0_prob_concerned_stat','70% highly concerned'),(116512,2124,'_problem_icons_0_prob_concerned_stat','field_640fa0dd81d95'),(116513,2124,'problem_icons_0_prob_concerded_text','are highly concerned'),(116514,2124,'_problem_icons_0_prob_concerded_text','field_640fa10181d96'),(116515,2124,'problem_icons_0_prob_issue_text',''),(116516,2124,'_problem_icons_0_prob_issue_text','field_640fa11a81d97'),(116517,2124,'problem_icons','4'),(116518,2124,'_problem_icons','field_640fa0191d518'),(116519,2124,'ceh_content_left',''),(116520,2124,'_ceh_content_left','field_640e97e8f1c8c'),(116521,2124,'ceh_content_right',''),(116522,2124,'_ceh_content_right','field_640e97fdf1c8d'),(116523,2124,'pc_content_left',''),(116524,2124,'_pc_content_left','field_640e983bf1c8f'),(116525,2124,'pc_content_right',''),(116526,2124,'_pc_content_right','field_640e984df1c90'),(116527,2124,'problem_icons_1_prob_icon','1699'),(116528,2124,'_problem_icons_1_prob_icon','field_640fa0291d519'),(116529,2124,'problem_icons_1_prob_concerned_stat','69% highly concerned'),(116530,2124,'_problem_icons_1_prob_concerned_stat','field_640fa0dd81d95'),(116531,2124,'problem_icons_1_prob_concerded_text','are highly concerned'),(116532,2124,'_problem_icons_1_prob_concerded_text','field_640fa10181d96'),(116533,2124,'problem_icons_1