d was completed by 4,735 people.'),(117310,2125,'_monitor_content','field_640fcc4014404'),(117311,2125,'problem_head','Housing in Australia is not working, and Australians are concerned.'),(117312,2125,'_problem_head','field_641935436aded'),(117313,2125,'problem_signoff','Explore the research showing how concerned Australians are our about the housing situation.'),(117314,2125,'_problem_signoff','field_641935626adee'),(117315,2125,'sections','a:2:{i:0;s:4:\"hero\";i:1;s:9:\"news_grid\";}'),(117316,2125,'_sections','field_5dafb40b8143a'),(117317,2125,'sections_0_is_full_height','1'),(117318,2125,'_sections_0_is_full_height','field_61d6f6fd5a37e'),(117319,2125,'sections_0_image','1648'),(117320,2125,'_sections_0_image','field_61d6f6d45a37d'),(117321,2125,'sections_0_heading','Heading'),(117322,2125,'_sections_0_heading','field_61d6f69e5a379'),(117323,2125,'sections_0_subtitle','Ya ya '),(117324,2125,'_sections_0_subtitle','field_61d6f6ac5a37a'),(117325,2125,'sections_0_link_one',''),(117326,2125,'_sections_0_link_one','field_61d6f6b55a37b'),(117327,2125,'sections_0_link_two',''),(117328,2125,'_sections_0_link_two','field_61d6f6c35a37c'),(117329,2125,'sections_1_select_categories','a:1:{i:0;s:2:\"27\";}'),(117330,2125,'_sections_1_select_categories','field_637f04483b63b'),(117331,2125,'intro_head_major','Super Consumers Australia is <span>fighting</span> to ensure that the superannuation industry is <span>held accountable</span> for the outcomes they deliver to Australian consumers.'),(117332,2125,'_intro_head_major','field_64e828783ad9f'),(117333,2125,'intro_head_minor','We want super to work for everyone—not just super fund companies. With our research, journalism and campaigns we are creating the trustworthy and transparent superannuation system we all deserve.'),(117334,2125,'_intro_head_minor','field_64e8288c3ada0'),(117335,2125,'intro_icons_0_int_icon','1922'),(117336,2125,'_intro_icons_0_int_icon','field_64e828b33ada2'),(117337,2125,'intro_icons_0_int_icon_text'