lve the complex problems we now face but there are some critical first steps to be taken now.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Set out an ambitious national housing agreement between commonwealth and state governments with targets and funding for the construction of affordable homes.</li>\r\n 	<li>Phase out tax breaks for property investors and using the increase in revenue to build more public housing.</li>\r\n 	<li>Establish laws which limit rental increases beyond what is fair.</li>\r\n 	<li>Rebalance tenancy laws to provide renters with more security and control, such as eliminating no grounds evictions.</li>\r\n 	<li>Phase out stamp duty and replace it with a broad-based land tax.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>While there are many opinions on what policy changes will fix the housing market, doing nothing is not an option.</h4>'),(121665,2161,'_solutions_content','field_640e8b307a958'),(121666,2161,'problem_icons_0_prob_icon','1699'),(121667,2161,'_problem_icons_0_prob_icon','field_640fa0291d519'),(121668,2161,'problem_icons_0_prob_concerned_stat','70% highly concerned'),(121669,2161,'_problem_icons_0_prob_concerned_stat','field_640fa0dd81d95'),(121670,2161,'problem_icons_0_prob_concerded_text','are highly concerned'),(121671,2161,'_problem_icons_0_prob_concerded_text','field_640fa10181d96'),(121672,2161,'problem_icons_0_prob_issue_text',''),(121673,2161,'_problem_icons_0_prob_issue_text','field_640fa11a81d97'),(121674,2161,'problem_icons','4'),(121675,2161,'_problem_icons','field_640fa0191d518'),(121676,2161,'ceh_content_left',''),(121677,2161,'_ceh_content_left','field_640e97e8f1c8c'),(121678,2161,'ceh_content_right',''),(121679,2161,'_ceh_content_right','field_640e97fdf1c8d'),(121680,2161,'pc_content_left',''),(121681,2161,'_pc_content_left','field_640e983bf1c8f'),(121682,2161,'pc_content_right',''),(121683,2161,'_pc_content_right','field_640e984df1c90'),(121684,2161,'problem_icons_1_prob_icon','1699'),(121685,2161,'_problem_icons_1_prob_icon','field_640fa0291d519'),(121686,2161,'pro