 placerat. Mauris in nibh leo. Aliquam aliquet ut lectus ac aliquet. Sed id dignissim sapien. Integer vehicula, ligula dapibus vehicula varius, libero massa scelerisque ipsum, sed interdum ligula nisl et arcu. Quisque sed eros metus.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Home','','inherit','closed','closed','','6-revision-v1','','','2023-03-01 04:38:35','2023-03-01 04:38:35','',6,'http://localhost/?p=1636',0,'revision','',0),(1637,1,'2023-03-01 04:43:29','2023-03-01 04:43:29','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>You can explore the results for households using the below category-tabs and within most sections you can sort the data by household-type, state/territory, region and other demographic characteristics.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Housing affordability','','inherit','closed','closed','','1550-revision-v1','','','2023-03-01 04:43:29','2023-03-01 04:43:29','',1550,'http://localhost/?p=1637',0,'revision','',0),(1638,1,'2023-03-01 04:44:05','2023-03-01 04:44:05','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>You can explore the results for households using the below category-tabs and within most sections you can sort the data by household-type, state/territory, region and other demographic characteristics.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Housing affordability','','inherit','closed','closed','','1550-revision-v1','','','2023-03-01 04:44:05','2023-03-01 04:44:05','',1550,'http://localhost/?p=1638',0,'revision','',0),(1639,1,'2023-03-01 04:44:32','2023-03-01 04:44:32','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Phasellus massa erat, consectetur at semper at, feugiat vel orci. Quisque consectetur egestas placerat. Mauris in nibh leo. Aliquam aliquet ut lectus ac aliquet. Sed id dignissim sapien. Integer vehicula, ligula dapibus vehicula varius, libero massa scelerisque ipsum, sed interdum ligula nisl et arcu. Quisque sed eros metus.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Home','','inherit','closed','closed','','6-revision-v1','','','2023-03-01 04:44:32','2023-03-01 04:44:32','',6,'http://localhost/?p=1639',0,'revision','',0),(1640,1,'2023-03-02 04:58:15','2023-03-02 04:58:15','<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3>Sentimrnt</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:file {\"id\":1281,\"href\":\"http://localhost:4000/wp-content/uploads/2021/06/ECSS-March-2021-Household-Topline-Figures.pdf\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-file\"><a id=\"wp-block-file--media-49087114-4abb-405f-851d-88b5ba43c8ed\" href=\"http://localhost:4000/wp-content/uploads/2021/06/ECSS-March-2021-Household-Topline-Figures.pdf\">ECSS March 2021 Household Topline Figures</a><a href=\"http://localhost:4000/wp-content/uploads/2021/06/ECSS-March-2021-Household-Topline-Figures.pdf\" class=\"wp-block-file__button\" download aria-describedby=\"wp-block-file--media-49087114-4abb-405f-851d-88b5ba43c8ed\">Download</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:file -->','Downloads','','inherit','closed','closed','','1276-revision-v1','','','2023-03-02 04:58:15','2023-03-02 04:58:15','',1276,'http://localhost/?p=1640',0,'revision','',0),(1643,1,'2023-03-09 03:52:11','2023-03-09 03:52:11','<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2><strong>Everybody’s home is different, but we all want the same thing: a place to build a fulfilling life.</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Australia is a rich country, but despite our growing national wealth, for many people the Australian dream seems increasingly out of reach.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li>Renters are seeing huge price increases and insecure tenancy agreements.</li><li>First home buyers are struggling to scrape together a deposit.</li><li>Low-income families are facing years on the waiting list for social housing.</li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Housing policies at the national, state, and local level are failing to provide reasonable pathways for people to find a place to call home.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Home','','inherit','closed','closed','','6-revision-v1','','','2023-03-09 03:52:11','2023-03-09 03:52:11','',6,'http://localhost/?p=1643',0,'revision','',0),(1644,1,'2023-03-09 03:52:56','2023-03-09 03:52:56','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Australia is a rich country, but despite our growing national wealth, for many people the Australian dream seems increasingly out of reach.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li>Renters are seeing huge price increases and insecure tenancy agreements.</li><li>First home buyers are struggling to scrape together a deposit.</li><li>Low-income families are facing years on the waiting list for social housing.</li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Housing policies at the national, state, and local level are failing to provide reasonable pathways for people to find a place to call home.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Home','','inherit','closed','closed','','6-revision-v1','','','2023-03-09 03:52:56','2023-03-09 03:52:56','',6,'http://localhost/?p=1644',0,'revision','',0),(1646,1,'2023-03-09 05:22:41','2023-03-09 05:22:41','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>You can explore the results for households using the below category-tabs and within most sections you can sort the data by household-type, state/territory, region and other demographic characteristics.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Housing affordability','','inherit','closed','closed','','1550-revision-v1','','','2023-03-09 05:22:41','2023-03-09 05:22:41','',1550,'http://localhost/?p=1646',0,'revision','',0),(1647,1,'2023-03-09 05:23:12','2023-03-09 05:23:12','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Australia is a rich country, but despite our growing national wealth, for many people the Australian dream seems increasingly out of reach.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li>Renters are seeing huge price increases and insecure tenancy agreements.</li><li>First home buyers are struggling to scrape together a deposit.</li><li>Low-income families are facing years on the waiting list for social housing.</li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Housing policies at the national, state, and local level are failing to provide reasonable pathways for people to find a place to call home.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Home','','inherit','closed','closed','','6-revision-v1','','','2023-03-09 05:23:12','2023-03-09 05:23:12','',6,'http://localhost/?p=1647',0,'revision','',0),(1651,1,'2023-03-13 00:07:36','2023-03-13 00:07:36','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Intro text....</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Issues with Australia’s housing system','','publish','closed','closed','','issues-with-australias-housing-system','','','2023-08-31 02:40:16','2023-08-31 02:40:16','',0,'http://localhost/?page_id=1651',0,'page','',0),(1652,1,'2023-03-13 00:07:36','2023-03-13 00:07:36','','Issues with Australia’s housing system','','inherit','closed','closed','','1651-revision-v1','','','2023-03-13 00:07:36','2023-03-13 00:07:36','',1651,'http://localhost/?p=1652',0,'revision','',0),(1653,1,'2023-03-13 00:08:06','2023-03-13 00:08:06','','Issues with Australia’s housing system','','inherit','closed','closed','','1651-revision-v1','','','2023-03-13 00:08:06','2023-03-13 00:08:06','',1651,'http://localhost/?p=1653',0,'revision','',0),(1654,1,'2023-03-13 00:12:48','2023-03-13 00:12:48','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Intro text....</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Issues with Australia’s housing system','','inherit','closed','closed','','1651-revision-v1','','','2023-03-13 00:12:48','2023-03-13 00:12:48','',1651,'http://localhost/?p=1654',0,'revision','',0),(1656,1,'2023-03-13 00:17:31','2023-03-13 00:17:31','<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3>Everybody’s home is different, but we all want the same thing: a place to build a fulfilling life.</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Australia is a rich country, but despite our growing national wealth, for many people the Australian dream seems increasingly out of reach.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li>Renters are seeing huge price increases and ins