ce to build a fulfilling life.</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Australia is a rich country, but despite our growing national wealth, for many people the Australian dream seems increasingly out of reach.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Renters are seeing huge price increases and insecure tenancy agreements.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>First home buyers are struggling to scrape together a deposit.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Low-income families are facing years on the waiting list for social housing.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Housing policies at the national, state, and local level are failing to provide reasonable pathways for people to find a place to call home.</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->','Home','','draft','closed','closed','','','','','2023-10-20 20:40:47','0000-00-00 00:00:00','',0,'http://localhost/?page_id=2005',0,'page','',0),(2006,1,'2023-10-20 20:46:53','2023-10-20 20:46:53','<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Everybody’s home is different, but we all want the same thing: a place to build a fulfilling life.</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Australia is a rich country, but despite our growing national wealth, for many people the Australian dream seems increasingly out of reach.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Renters are seeing huge price increases and insecure tenancy agreements.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>First home buyers are struggling to scrape together a deposit.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Low-income families are facing years on the waiting list for social housing.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Housing policies at the national, state, and local level are failing to provide reasonable pathways for people to find a place to call home.</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->','Home','','inherit','closed','closed','','6-revision-v1','','','2023-10-20 20:46:53','2023-10-20 20:46:53','',6,'http://localhost/?p=2006',0,'revision','',0),(2007,1,'2023-10-21 02:38:27','2023-10-21 02:38:27','<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Everybody’s home is different, but we all want the same thing: a place to build a fulfilling life.</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Australia is a rich country, but despite our growing national wealth, for many people the Australian dream seems increasingly out of reach.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Renters are seeing huge price increases and insecure tenancy agreements.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>First home buyers are struggling to scrape together a deposit.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Low-income families are facing years on the waiting list for social housing.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Housing policies at the national, state, and local level are failing to provide reasonable pathways for people to find a place to call home.</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->','Home','','inherit','closed','closed','','6-revision-v1','','','2023-10-21 02:38:27','2023-10-21 02:38:27','',6,'http://localhost/?p=2007',0,'revision','',0),(2008,1,'2023-10-21 02:40:21','2023-10-21 02:40:21','<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Everybody’s home is different, but we all want the same thing: a place to build a fulfilling life.</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Australia is a rich country, but despite our growing national wealth, for many people the Australian dream seems increasingly out of reach.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Renters are seeing huge price increases and insecure tenancy agreements.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>First home buyers are struggling to scrape together a deposit.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Low-income families are facing years on the waiting list for social housing.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Housing policies at the national, state, and local level are failing to provide reasonable pathways for people to find a place to call home.</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->','Home','','inherit','closed','closed','','6-revision-v1','','','2023-10-21 02:40:21','2023-10-21 02:40:21','',6,'http://localhost/?p=2008',0,'revision','',0),(2009,1,'2023-10-24 04:59:53','2023-10-24 04:59:53','<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">We want to hear your stories of navigating Australia’s superannuation system.</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Real-life case studies are invaluable for inclusion in our investigative journalism and our submissions to decision-makers. Together, we can hold the industry accountable and make the superannuation system work for everyone.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Do you find the superannuation system confusing? Have you got a complaint about your super and found it difficult to get action or answers from your fund? Has your boss ever withheld your super payments? Did you find out that your super account includes unexpected fees or insurance you didn’t ask for? Have you had an insurance claim knocked back by your super fund?</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Whatever your experience, your story can help us advocate for consumers and create a fairer superannuation system. Fill out the form on this page—it just takes a minute!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Your Stories','','publish','closed','closed','','your-stories','','','2023-10-24 05:36:16','2023-10-24 05:36:16','',0,'http://localhost/?page_id=2009',0,'page','',0),(2010,1,'2023-10-24 04:59:53','2023-10-24 04:59:53','','Your Stories','','inherit','closed','closed','','2009-revision-v1','','','2023-10-24 04:59:53','2023-10-24 04:59:53','',2009,'http://localhost/?p=2010',0,'revision','',0),(2011,1,'2023-10-24 05:00:04','2023-10-24 05:00:04','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Content...</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Your Stories','','inherit','closed','closed','','2009-revision-v1','','','2023-10-24 05:00:04','2023-10-24 05:00:04','',2009,'http://localhost/?p=2011',0,'revision','',0),(2012,1,'2023-10-24 05:03:08','2023-10-24 05:03:08','','engineer-wide','','inherit','open','closed','','engineer-wide','','','2023-10-24 05:03:08','2023-10-24 05:03:08','',2009,'http://localhost/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/engineer-wide.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(2013,1,'2023-10-24 05:11:32','2023-10-24 05:11:32','a:8:{s:8:\"location\";a:2:{i:0;a:1:{i:0;a:3:{s:5:\"param\";s:9:\"post_type\";s:8:\"operator\";s:2:\"==\";s:5:\"value\";s:8:\"projects\";}}i:1;a:1:{i:0;a:3:{s:5:\"param\";s:9:\"post_type\";s:8:\"operator\";s:2:\"==\";s:5:\"value\";s:6:\"events\";}}}s:8:\"position\";s:6:\"normal\";s:5:\"style\";s:7:\"default\";s:15:\"label_placement\";s:3:\"top\";s:21:\"instruction_placement\";s:5:\"label\";s:14:\"hide_on_screen\";s:0:\"\";s:11:\"description\";s:0:\"\";s:12:\"show_in_rest\";i:0;}','Take action elements','take-action-elements','publish','closed','closed','','group_64f15c5023a49','','','2024-05-16 03:46:40','2024-05-16 03:46:40','',0,'http://localhost/?p=2013',0,'acf-field-group','',0),(2014,1,'2023-10-24 05:11:32','2023-10-24 05:11:32','a:8:{s:10:\"aria-label\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"type\";s:3:\"tab\";s:12:\"instructions\";s:0:\"\";s:8:\"required\";i:0;s:17:\"conditional_logic\";i:0;s:7:\"wrapper\";a:3:{s:5:\"width\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\